            "description": "Replaces the whole cart. The shop is DERIVED from the products — every line must be from the same shop's storefront (mixed → 400). Each line also validated (on that storefront, active, ≥ minOrderQty, no dupes → 400). PUT a coherent list from another shop and the cart switches to it."
